title: "AD-TRACE: Alzheimer's Disease Protein Sequence Classification & Multi-Modal Benchmark"
abstract: "A rigorous, zero-leakage computational biology platform and machine learning benchmark for classifying Alzheimer's Disease (MONDO_0004975) associated proteins directly from sequence representations, molecular biophysics, and interactome networks."
